   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,249:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ]
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,250:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Section 7.3: 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,250:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,253:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the optimal policy for a budget-constrained government is to allocate the
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,254:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: entire budget to vouchers
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,254:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
