   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,256:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: representativeness.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,257:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  12 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,258:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: [
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,258:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: MINOR
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,259:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ]
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,260:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Section 2.1: 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,260:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,262:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: our midline voucher effect of 39.9 percentage points is among the largest in
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,263:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the literature
   DEBUG: 2026-04-08 09:39:29,264:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
